# Named config.toml presets written by Ranko Utils -> Profiles. The folder is tracked, its
# presets are local: `configs/*` (not `configs/*.toml`) so a preset is ignored whatever its
# extension, with the placeholder re-included.
configs/*
!configs/.gitkeep
